Gather->
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is a message routing step that merges messages from different routes into a single message with
the option to define certain strategies on how to combine the initial messages you can use gather in
scenarios where you need to consolidate messages that are split or multicast in the integration flow.
-> if you want to gather the records  which got  multicast or which got split in cpi in to a single data is called gather
-> The Gather step merges messages from different routes (into a single message) with the option to define certain
strategies how to combine the initial messages.


